:: WLI Lake Area
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

You approach the spot where the presence feels strongest.<br>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" and !$wraithcompoundmessage and !$weekly.wliModGift>>
	<<gifticon "love">><<link [[ Leave an offering | WLI Lake Offering List ]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The presence fades.<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<lakeicon>><<link [[ Back (0:05) | Lake Shore ]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: WLI Lake Offering List
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

What would you like to offer?
<br><br>
<<food_gift_list>>

<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
	<<skinicon "give">><<link [[ Offer (0:05) | WLI Lake Offering]]>><<pass 5>><<give_gift "Ivory Wraith">><<set $weekly.wliModGift to true>><</link>>
<</if>>

<br>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[ Reconsider | WLI Lake Offering Reconsider ]]>><</link>>


:: WLI Lake Offering Reconsider
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

Best not to indulge an eldritch horror.

<br><br>
<<lakeicon>><<link [[ Back (0:05) | Lake Shore ]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: WLI Lake Offering
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

<<if W.wraithIsAngry()>>
	"I want to make things right. Please accept my apology," 
<<else>>
	"I've brought you something," 
<</if>>
<<set _gift to setup.foodstuff[$gift].name + (setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>>
<<wearProp _gift>>

you announce, setting the _gift on a nearby rock and waiting for a reaction. <br>

<<if $wli.criteria and !$wli.giftevent and C.npc["Ivory Wraith"].love gte 25>>
	<span class="teal">An idea strikes you.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[ Offer your body as a vessel | WLI Lake Possessed ]]>><<npcincr "Ivory Wraith" love 2>><</link>><<gglove>>
<</if>>

<br>
<<link [[ Wait (0:??) | WLI Lake Offering Accept ]]>><<set _rng to random(1, 10)>><<pass _rng>><</link>>


:: WLI Lake Offering Accept
<<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
Mist erupts from the lake just as you're about to give up. It stretches, enveloping the <<recipe_name $gift>> in lazy swirls. You blink, and the <<recipe_name $gift>> is simply <span class="red">gone.</span><<gtrauma>><<trauma 6>><br><br>

<<if W.wraithIsAngry()>>
	The presence seems <span class="blue">a little calmer.</span> <<npcincr "Ivory Wraith" love 1>><<glove>><<lobsession 1>>
<<else>>
	The presence seems <span class="blue">pleased.</span> <<npcincr "Ivory Wraith" love 2>><<gglove>><<gobsession 1>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
The mist dissipates, leaving a sweet scent behind.
<br><br>
<<lakeicon>><<link [[ Back (0:05) | Lake Shore ]]>><<endevent>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: WLI Lake Possessed
<<effects>><<wraithPossess>><<set $wli.giftevent to 1>>

"I'll lend you my body. So you can eat properly," you offer.

<br><br>
The mist freezes. A pale visage appears before you.<br>
<span class="wraith">"Clever <<pcpetname "wraith">>. </span> 

<<if W.wraithIsAngry()>>
	<span class="wraith">Do you seek to repent?"</span> 
	It inspects you from head to toe, gauging your honesty with intense <<wraithEyes>> eyes. Its gaze lulls you into a trance.
<<else>>
	<span class="wraith">Does your kindness truly know no bounds?"</span>
	You shudder as its pale, cold hands cup your cheeks. It smiles at you. You can feel your heart pounding.
<</if>>

<br><br>
It dissipates into mist, enveloping you in a hazy embrace. Sooner than you realize, your body goes numb. You can only watch as your hands clench and unclench on their own.

<br><br>
<span class="wraith"><<link [[ Next | WLI Lake Possessed Eat 2]]>><</link>></span>


:: WLI Lake Possessed Eat 2
<<effects>>
You turn. It's hard to tell your thoughts apart. For a moment you just stare at the <<recipe_name $gift>>, unsure of what to do. The very thought of eating seems foreign. You must have forgotten how to, after so long. 
<br><br>

At last, you find the courage to sample it. <br>
You close your eyes as the rich flavour fills your mouth. It brings back memories.

<br><br>
Memories that are not your own. You try to dwell on them, if only for a moment.<br>
Faces from people you think you knew overlap until they're barely human. Familiar voices morph together and turn into a cacophony. Your sanity falters with the weight of what seems like multiple lifetimes relived at once, rather than a single one.

<br><br>
<span class="wraith"><<link [[ Focus | WLI Lake Possessed Eat 3 ]]>><</link>></span>


:: WLI Lake Possessed Eat 3
<<effects>>
You focus, and the vision becomes clear again.

<<if $wraithPrison and $wraithPrison.vision>>
	You know this place. <span class="red">You have seen this before.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
You're bound to a plinth, clutching your necklace.<br>
Your throat feels sore, likely from screaming, but nobody comes to your aid. You struggle against your bindings as the water floods your surroundings. You close your eyes, whispering a desperate prayer that goes unanswered.

<br><br>
The water immerses you completely. It feels so cold, yet your lungs burn. <br>

<<set $pain to 100>>
<<if $wraith.state is "haunt">>
	<<if $wraithPrison and $wraithPrison.vision>>
		Your sins weigh you down. A profound guilt washes over you. <span class="red">No amount of gifting will lift the weight of what you've done.</span><br>
	<<else>>
		You feel like you did something terrible, though you cannot immediatelly grasp what.<br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $wraith.state is "active">>
	<span class="blue">At least you still have it.</span><br>
<<else>>
	A profound sense of loss washes over you.
<</if>>

You didn't want to remember this. Not right now. <<ggtrauma>><<trauma 18>>
<br><br>
<span class="wraith"><<link [[ Drown | WLI Lake Possessed Eat 4 ]]>><</link>></span>


:: WLI Lake Possessed Eat 4
<<effects>>
It's too much. You pass out. <<set _rng to random(5, 30)>>

<br><br>
<<link [[ Everything fades to black... | WLI Lake Possessed Eat Finish ]]>><<set $pain to 0>><<endevent>><<pass _rng>><</link>>


:: WLI Lake Possessed Eat Finish
<<effects>><<wraithExorcise true true>>
You're coughing. Something is stuck in your throat. You <span class="blue">spit a piece of <<recipe_name $gift>></span>.<br><br>
You open your eyes, taking a deep breath. You're still at the lake.<br>
The <<recipe_name $gift>> lies forgotten on the rock, only half-touched. The pale figure is nowhere to be seen. You don't remember when it left your body.

<br><br>
You decide not to linger.
<br><br>
<<lakeicon>><<link [[ Back (0:05) | Lake Shore ]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
